# --- Model weights and checkpoints ----------------------------------------
# Never commit weights. The Stage 2b extractor checkpoint is 2.26 GB and is
# regenerated by scripts/train_stage2b.py (~108 min on an M4 Max). Target model
# weights are downloaded from Hugging Face, not vendored.
*.pt
*.pth
*.bin
*.ckpt
*.gguf
*.onnx
*.mlpackage/
*.safetensors
models/
checkpoints/

# --- Local caches and datasets --------------------------------------------
.cache/
hf_cache/
data/
datasets/
pages/

# --- Logs and scratch -----------------------------------------------------
*.log
nohup.out
scratch/
tmp/

# --- Results ---------------------------------------------------------------
# results/ is committed ON PURPOSE: the raw JSON/CSV and generated tables are the
# primary record of this study, including the negative Stage 3 result. Only the
# binary artifacts above are excluded (the *.pt / *.safetensors rules cover them).
